linq bundles no third-party data, but downloads one database at runtime.

IP Geolocation by DB-IP — https://db-ip.com

The DB-IP Country Lite database is fetched at boot into LINQ_DATA_DIR and used
to resolve a click's country. It is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The attribution shown in the Admin UI, beside every display of its results,
satisfies that licence. Removing it ends the grant. Set LINQ_GEO_ENABLED=false
to switch the download and the lookup off entirely.
